      "start": 579.64,
      "end": 581.25,
      "en": "I bet she's going to teach me how to play Mahjong.",
      "zh": "我敢说奶奶会教我打麻将。"
    },
    {
      "id": 222,
      "start": 581.85,
      "end": 582.43,
      "en": "Hey, dad.",
      "zh": "嘿，爸爸。"
    },
    {
      "id": 223,
      "start": 582.6,
      "end": 585.04,
      "en": "Are you going to buy me firecrackers this year?",
      "zh": "今年你要给我买鞭炮吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 224,
      "start": 585.04,
      "end": 586.64,
      "en": "We're going to have the best fireworks.",
      "zh": "我们要放最漂亮的烟花。"
    },
    {
      "id": 225,
      "start": 586.64,
      "end": 588.11,
      "en": "I'm really looking forward to lighting them.",
      "zh": "我真想赶快点燃它们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 226,
      "start": 588.57,
      "end": 590.83,
      "en": "Son, firecrackers aren't toys.",
      "zh": "儿子，鞭炮不是玩具。"
    },
    {
      "id": 227,
      "start": 591.53,
      "end": 592.01,
      "en": "They are dangerous.",
      "zh": "它们很危险。"
    },
    {
      "id": 228,
      "start": 593.0,
      "end": 595.0,
      "en": "No, fireworks are awesome.",
      "zh": "不，烟花可棒了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 595.07,
      "end": 595.45,
      "en": "Wow.",
      "zh": "哇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 596.13,
      "end": 596.81,
      "en": "Don't you remember?",
      "zh": "你不记得了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 597.57,
      "end": 602.83,
      "en": "Last year when I set out the firecrackers, you covered both your ears and hid behind your mother.",
      "zh": "去年我放鞭炮的时候，你捂住了耳朵，躲在妈妈身后。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 603.44,
      "end": 606.4,
      "en": "Dad, I was scared because I saw a bug.",
      "zh": "爸，我是看见虫子才吓着的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 606.4,
      "end": 606.57,
      "en": "That's all.",
      "zh": "就这些。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 607.4,
      "end": 607.85,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 608.62,
      "end": 611.3,
      "en": "Oh, and I can't wait to watch the dragon dance.",
      "zh": "我还迫不及待想看舞龙呢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 611.8,
      "end": 613.8,
      "en": "Dad, can I sit on your shoulders this time?",
      "zh": "爸，这次我能骑在你肩上吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 614.02,
      "end": 615.52,
      "en": "Hey, I offered last year.",
      "zh": "嘿，去年我就说可以了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 616.1,
      "end": 617.0,
      "en": "Well, I...",
      "zh": "嗯，我……"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 617.0,
      "end": 619.12,
      "en": "Anyways, I was just thinking of the red envelopes.",
      "zh": "反正我刚才在想红包。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 619.52,
      "end": 622.34,
      "en": "I want to make a list of all the things I'm going to buy with my red envelope money.",
      "zh": "我要列个清单，看看红包钱都买些什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 622.76,
      "end": 623.2,
      "en": "I can't wait.",
      "zh": "我等不及了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 623.76,
      "end": 624.82,
      "en": "I'm going to have so much money.",
      "zh": "我会有好多钱！"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 625.2,
      "end": 627.06,
      "en": "Mom, can I get a pen and a piece of paper?",
      "zh": "妈妈，我可以买一支笔和一张纸吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 627.9,
      "end": 628.62,
      "en": "I want a new transformer.",
      "zh": "我想要一个新的变形金刚。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 628.94,
      "end": 629.92,
      "en": "No, two transformers.",
      "zh": "不，是两个变形金刚。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 629.92,
      "end": 630.92,
      "en": "Optimus Prime.",
      "zh": "擎天柱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 631.24,
      "end": 631.42,
      "en": "Wheeljack.",
      "zh": "千斤顶，变形金刚中的角色。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 631.88,
      "end": 632.68,
      "en": "I'll get a PSP game.",
      "zh": "我还要买一款PSP游戏。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 632.92,
      "end": 633.92,
      "en": "Ha ha.",
      "zh": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 633.92,
      "end": 647.2,
      "en": "I'm going to get a new game.",
      "zh": "我要买一个新游戏。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 647.2,
      "end": 650.49,
      "en": "So Daini, what are these red packets of money about?",
      "zh": "那么戴尼，这些红包钱是关于什么的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 651.26,
      "end": 656.35,
      "en": "So in Chinese, we call it 紅包 hóngbāo, and it's basically a bag full of money.",
      "zh": "所以在中文中，我们称它为红包，它基本上是一个装满金钱的袋子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 657.0,
      "end": 657.67,
      "en": "Why do you get money?",
      "zh": "你为什么要钱？"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 658.32,
      "end": 658.57,
      "en": "As a gift.",
      "zh": "作为礼物。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 659.32,
      "end": 660.32,
      "en": "As a gift.",
      "zh": "作为礼物。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 660.32,
      "end": 661.32,
      "en": "Wow.",
      "zh": "哇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 661.32,
      "end": 662.68,
      "en": "Do children get it though?",
      "zh": "孩子们会得到它吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 662.68,
      "end": 663.71,
      "en": "Only children get it.",
      "zh": "只有孩子才能得到它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 664.16,
      "end": 665.16,
      "en": "Wow.",
      "zh": "哇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 665.16,
      "end": 672.11,
      "en": "If you're a university student and you haven't got a job yet, then you can still ask for 紅包 hóngbāo from your parents or your relatives.",
      "zh": "如果你是一名大学生，你还没有找到工作，那么你仍然可以向你的父母或你的亲戚索要红包。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 672.84,
      "end": 676.15,
      "en": "So is there some meaning to this gift of money?",
      "zh": "那么这笔钱的礼物有什么意义吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 676.45,
      "end": 685.03,
      "en": "Well, it is believed that children have to put these red envelopes under their pillow on New Year's Eve to scare away the evil spirits.",
      "zh": "好吧，据信孩子们在除夕夜必须把这些红包放在枕头下，以吓跑邪灵。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 685.28,
      "end": 686.76,
      "en": "Again, like the firecrackers.",
      "zh": "再次，就像鞭炮一样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 686.76,
      "end": 687.76,
      "en": "Again, evil spirits.",
      "zh": "再次，邪恶的灵魂。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 687.76,
      "end": 688.81,
      "en": "A lot of evil spirits in China.",
      "zh": "中国有很多邪恶的灵魂。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 691.36,
      "end": 694.51,
      "en": "So Daini, how much money would a kid get for Chinese New Year?",
      "zh": "那么戴尼，一个孩子的中国新年能得到多少钱？"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 694.79,
      "end": 699.21,
      "en": "Well, when I was little, the best year I got was 3000 RMB.",
      "zh": "嗯，小时候，我得到的最好的一年是 3000 元。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 699.68,
      "end": 701.13,
      "en": "Which is like almost...",
      "zh": "这几乎就像..."
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 701.28,
      "end": 701.81,
      "en": "500 dollars.",
      "zh": "500美元。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 702.28,
      "end": 703.28,
      "en": "Wow.",
      "zh": "哇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 703.28,
      "end": 704.28,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 704.28,
      "end": 706.96,
      "en": "I was so rich at that time.",
      "zh": "那时我太有钱了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 706.96,
      "end": 709.0,
      "en": "Wow, amazing.",
      "zh": "哇，太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 709.0,
      "end": 712.76,
      "en": "What about this game, 麻將 mājiǎng?",
      "zh": "这游戏怎么样呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 712.76,
      "end": 713.23,
      "en": "Have you played it?",
      "zh": "你玩过吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 713.76,
      "end": 714.76,
      "en": "No.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 714.76,
      "end": 715.76,
      "en": "No.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 715.76,
      "end": 723.84,
      "en": "And again, it's a very traditional Chinese game and you will see senior people always gathering along the table.",
      "zh": "再说一次，这是一个非常传统的中国游戏，你会看到老人总是聚集在桌子旁。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 723.84,
      "end": 724.47,
      "en": "So old people.",
      "zh": "这么老人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 724.84,
      "end": 725.84,
      "en": "Old people.",
      "zh": "老人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 725.84,
      "end": 727.72,
      "en": "So it's like a board game, kind of like chess?",
      "zh": "所以这就像棋盘游戏，有点像国际象棋？"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 727.72,
      "end": 731.07,
      "en": "It's kind of like chess, but they have like specially made chess.",
      "zh": "这有点像国际象棋，但他们喜欢特制的国际象棋。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 731.84,
      "end": 732.27,
      "en": "It's very different.",
      "zh": "这是非常不同的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 732.84,
      "end": 733.05,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 733.84,
      "end": 738.8,
      "en": "So I want to know more about the fireworks and firecrackers on Chinese New Year.",
      "zh": "所以我想更多地了解农历新年的烟花和鞭炮。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 739.01,
      "end": 741.35,
      "en": "Okay, usually we buy firecrackers.",
      "zh": "好吧，通常我们会买鞭炮。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 742.13,
      "end": 744.47,
      "en": "I believe fireworks are more expensive.",
      "zh": "我相信烟花更贵。"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 745.04,
      "end": 748.08,
      "en": "So we play firecrackers, 炮仗 pàozhàng.",
      "zh": "于是我们玩了鞭炮，火爆。"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 748.08,
      "end": 751.24,
      "en": "And usually we do it right after midnight.",
      "zh": "通常我们会在午夜之后做。"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 752.12,
      "end": 754.32,
      "en": "So 12 o'clock.",
      "zh": "所以12点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 754.32,
      "end": 754.96,
      "en": "It's very loud.",
      "zh": "声音很大。"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 755.32,
      "end": 766.6,
      "en": "And say for example, I personally don't even dare to stay close when they set off the firecrackers because it's just way too loud.",
      "zh": "比如说，当他们放鞭炮时，我个人什至不敢靠近，因为它太响了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 766.6,
      "end": 767.96,
      "en": "And everyone starts to light them.",
      "zh": "每个人都开始点亮它们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 767.96,
      "end": 768.96,
      "en": "So it's like...",
      "zh": "所以就像..."
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 768.96,
      "end": 769.96,
      "en": "No, it's amazing.",
      "zh": "不，这是惊人的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 770.26,
      "end": 773.28,
      "en": "I've seen Chinese New Year three times in China.",
      "zh": "我在中国看过三遍中国新年。"
    },
    {
      "id": 297,
      "start": 773.76,
      "end": 775.34,
      "en": "And each time I've just been amazed.",
      "zh": "每次我都感到惊讶。"
    },
    {
      "id": 298,
      "start": 776.6,
      "end": 779.44,
      "en": "It's so cool and so noisy and so awesome.",
      "zh": "它是如此酷，如此嘈杂，如此令人敬畏。"
    },
    {
      "id": 299,
      "start": 779.68,
      "end": 781.76,
      "en": "I mean, you've got to visit China to see this.",
      "zh": "我的意思是，你必须访问中国才能看到这个。"
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "start": 781.88,
      "end": 783.14,
      "en": "Yeah, it's a really cool festival.",
      "zh": "是的，这是一个非常酷的节日。"
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "start": 783.76,
      "end": 786.0,
      "en": "And definitely playing with firecrackers is always fun.",
      "zh": "绝对玩鞭炮总是很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "start": 786.66,
      "end": 788.2,
      "en": "Yeah, maybe a little bit dangerous.",
      "zh": "是的，也许有点危险。"
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "start": 788.98,
      "end": 793.28,
      "en": "Well everyone, we've just learned about how New Year's is celebrated in China.",
      "zh": "大家好，我们刚刚了解到新年是如何在中国庆祝的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 304,
      "start": 793.28,
      "end": 796.62,
      "en": "And we want to know how do you celebrate New Year's in your country?",
      "zh": "我们想知道你如何在你的国家庆祝新年？"
    },
    {
      "id": 305,
      "start": 796.92,
      "end": 797.12,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 306,
      "start": 797.56,
      "end": 799.02,
      "en": "How do you welcome the New Year?",
      "zh": "你如何迎接新的一年？"
    },
    {
      "id": 307,
      "start": 799.18,
      "end": 800.54,
      "en": "How do you scare away evil spirits?",
      "zh": "你如何吓跑邪灵？"
    },
    {
      "id": 308,
      "start": 802.44,
      "end": 806.58,
      "en": "So come to our website at EnglishPod.com and leave us your comments.",
      "zh": "因此，请访问我们的网站 englishpod.com 并留下您的意见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 309,
      "start": 807.44,
      "end": 808.44,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 310,
      "start": 808.44,
      "end": 809.9,
      "en": "Daini, Erica and I will be there to answer all your questions.",
      "zh": "戴尼、埃里卡和我会在那里回答你所有的问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 311,
      "start": 810.28,
      "end": 811.74,
      "en": "So be sure to send us some comments.",
      "zh": "所以一定要给我们发一些评论。"
    },
    {
      "id": 312,
      "start": 812.44,
      "end": 813.44,
      "en": "Well everyone, thanks for listening.",
      "zh": "大家好，感谢收听。"
    },
    {
      "id": 313,
      "start": 813.98,
      "end": 814.98,
      "en": "And until next time, bye.",
      "zh": "直到下一次，再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 314,
      "start": 814.98,
      "end": 815.98,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 315,
      "start": 815.98,
      "end": 823.171,
      "en": "Hi, bye.",
      "zh": "你好，再见。"
    }
  ],
